  "integrationChanges": [
    "App-owned model/effort preferences, context usage and account data replace documentation-site services.",
    "Backend settings, segments and response details are deferred menu actions.",
    "Public result and artifact data use the same website ToolTraceCard.",
    "Feedback markup is copied from the website; transport persists to PocketBase.",
    "Documentation-only budget, account login and memory services are replaced by app integration.",
    "Input gets an accessible label; unsupported historical actions are disabled."
